rovider Python script fixture\n      - CLI launch and resume command execution\n      - provider request JSONL recording\n      - state.db invocation row assertions through rusqlite\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/s10_external_launch_session.rs\n    role: test-harness\n    Surface:\n      - external provider executor service fixture\n      - policy.evaluate and launch request capture\n      - LaunchExit session capture assertions\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/provider_registry.rs\n    role: test-harness\n    Surface:\n      - provider artifact registry fixture\n      - temporary PATH and executable binary fixture\n      - missing artifact diagnostics\n  - component: crates/oulipoly-provider/tests/client_invoke.rs\n    role: test-harness\n    Surface:\n      - provider client subprocess fixture\n      - describe response JSON compatibility assertions\n```\n\nNo `state.db` schema migration is declared or required by this gate.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":307,"totalLines":307,"truncated":false}},"title":"planning/s10b-gate/contracts/s10b.contract.md","time":{"start":1780750076027,"end":1780750076040}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_02029c88d6a67832016a2416f9998c8197ba6e346bb8eab6a6"}},"id":"prt_e9cf9c72a001yuO8NsFzvVMJXP","sessionID":"ses_1630697c1ffencF2CGpTsVCUsu","messageID":"msg_e9cf987d30012MMwx9u6tJUKv4"}}
